  "final_report": "- nu_t/nu scales with u_tau y/nu (i.e. y+): eddy viscosity grows with wall-normal distance as turbulent mixing (u_tau y) overtakes molecular diffusion nu. Fit shows high R2 but is empirical/regime-specific (validation caveat).\n- RAG grounding: retrieved \"normalized eddy viscosity\" exactly matches nu_t/nu. Closest documented groups are Re_tau = u_tau h/nu and y/h; no exact classical identity with u_tau y/nu, though u_tau y/nu = Re_tau*(y/h), so Re_tau and y/h provide outer‑vs‑viscous length context.",
